"relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "459fdd74-1b35-4301-b012-e4eff46a9ffe", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "1", "file_name": "employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/shivaniraj/Desktop/llamaindex-pdf-rag-assistant/data/documents/employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 25348, "creation_date": "2026-09-01", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-01"}, "hash": "fe0b91ee4d21a92452b86dd20d98d2417d74fd3bca7ab6c47a36d1c5648b47e5", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "NovaTech Solutions\n Employee Handbook\nSample document created for learning PDF ingestion, chunking, embeddings, retrieval, and RAG with\nLlamaIndex.\n1. Working Hours\nThe standard working schedule is Monday through Friday. Employees are expected to work from 9:30 AM\nto 6:00 PM. Employees may request flexible working hours with approval from their reporting manager.\n2. Annual Leave Policy\nEvery full-time employee receives 24 days of paid annual leave per calendar year. Annual leave should\nnormally be requested at least five working days in advance. Requests are subject to manager approval\nand team availability.\n3. Sick Leave\nEmployees receive 10 days of paid sick leave per calendar year. If an employee is absent for more than two\nconsecutive working days because of illness, the company may request appropriate supporting\ndocumentation.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 843, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "3efcb924-2ea5-486b-8efb-77c7d591a3e4": {"__data__": {"id_": "3efcb924-2ea5-486b-8efb-77c7d591a3e4", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/shivaniraj/Desktop/llamaindex-pdf-rag-assistant/data/documents/employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 25348, "creation_date": "2026-09-01", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-01"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "904e7e84-38ea-4f4d-9fd3-85b0b4794177", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/shivaniraj/Desktop/llamaindex-pdf-rag-assistant/data/documents/employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 25348, "creation_date": "2026-09-01", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-01"}, "hash": "f63dd8e82ca041d60b38fc3c6774a5f6c17462cab5af636c811c84a6c8d14945", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "4. Remote Work Policy\nEmployees may work remotely for up to two days per week after receiving approval from their reporting\nmanager. Employees working remotely must remain available during agreed working hours and must follow\ncompany information-security requirements.\n5. Expense Reimbursement\nApproved business expenses should be submitted within 30 calendar days of the expense date. A valid\nreceipt is required for individual expenses above INR 1,000. The finance team reviews submitted claims\nbefore reimbursement.\n6. Information Security\nEmployees must not share company passwords, API keys, authentication tokens, or confidential customer\ninformation with unauthorized persons. Company credentials must not be stored in public source-code\nrepositories. Suspected security incidents should be reported to the internal security team as soon as\npossible.\n7. Employee Support\nQuestions about leave, working hours, or employment policies should be directed to the Human Resources\nteam. Questions about expense claims should be directed to the Finance team.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1057, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "e2d1ee3f-1462-4708-9cc6-c512f3bf5a10": {"__data__": {"id_": "e2d1ee3f-1462-4708-9cc6-c512f3bf5a10", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "3", "file_name": "employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/shivaniraj/Desktop/llamaindex-pdf-rag-assistant/data/documents/employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 25348, "creation_date": "2026-09-01", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-01"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "d4f07951-5924-4fc0-8b7a-66c383b8a9e0", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "3", "file_name": "employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/shivaniraj/Desktop/llamaindex-pdf-rag-assistant/data/documents/employee_handbook_rag_sample.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 25348, "creation_date": "2026-09-01", "last_modified_date": "2026-09-01"}, "hash": "fa203a0823b2d8f924952a1cef3fc7da6b3ffda325422543bb0abbf842bef105", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "8. Example Knowledge Questions\n Question\nExpected fact in this handbook\nHow many annual leave days do employees receive?\n24 days per calendar year\nHow many remote-work days are allowed?\nUp to two days per week\nWhen should expenses be submitted?\nWithin 30 calendar days\nWhen is a receipt required?\nFor individual expenses above INR 1,000\nHow many sick leave days are provided?\n10 days per calendar year", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 401, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}, "docstore/metadata": {"06cf93c2-0fa1-4aa4-a540-0b00b7df412d": {"doc_hash": "f6f9060473950df05cd491e31af1221424325c7dbee01946d2906ae3213b00a3", "ref_doc_id": "459fdd74-1b35-4301-b012-e4eff46a9ffe"}, "3efcb924-2ea5-486b-8efb-77c7d591a3e4": {"doc_hash": "da9b1269d6d4cc2bdc67be0f45a2666cf002d5ed2cf2d6760a3331c98a64970f", "ref_doc_id": "904e7e84-38ea-4f4d-9fd3-85b0b4794177"}, "e2d1ee3f-1462-4708-9cc6-c512f3bf5a10": {"doc_hash": "21397644b853eb20770ccf47e91a293988326bead61dc999833f69bda13d879e", "ref_doc_id": "d4f07951-5924-4fc0-8b7a-66c383b8a9e0"}}}